      <p>NMN raises NAD⁺ availability. But every time your body metabolises NMN and its downstream byproduct nicotinamide, it uses up methyl groups via the SAM cycle. TMG is one of the most efficient methyl donors. Pairing them helps support the methylation pool while you're supplementing NMN long-term — the protocol most informed longevity researchers, including Dr. Sinclair publicly, describe pairing.*</p></details>

      <details><summary>Is 200 mg of NMN enough?</summary>
      <p>Clinical research has tested NMN doses from 250 mg up to 1,000 mg per day, with measurable changes in NAD⁺ markers across the range. We chose 200 mg per capsule so you can either take one for a maintenance dose or two if you want to mirror higher-end protocols. The TMG pairing scales with you either way.</p></details>

      <details><summary>Can I take this with other supplements?</summary>
      <p>Most adults pair Pure NMN + TMG with the basics — creatine, omega-3, vitamin D — without issue. If you're on prescription medication (especially anything affecting methylation, like SSRIs or methotrexate), check with your doctor first.</p></details>

      <details><summary>Will I feel something on day one?</summary>
      <p>Honestly, probably not. NAD⁺ supplementation isn't caffeine. The most common pattern is: nothing for 1–2 weeks, a quiet shift in afternoon steadiness around week 3–6, then a "wait, I didn't realise how much better I'd been feeling" moment if you ever run out around month 3.</p></details>

      <details><summary>How do I take it?</summary>
      <p>One capsule daily, with or without food. Morning is most popular but it's not stimulating — you can take it any time. Consistency matters far more than timing.</p></details>

      <details><summary>Is it safe to take long-term?</summary>
      <p>Both NMN and TMG have extensive safety data and have been consumed in human studies at multiples of the daily dose in our formulation. The pairing exists specifically because long-term NMN intake without methyl support can deplete methyl groups — TMG is the safeguard.</p></details>

      <details><summary>Is the capsule vegan?</summary>
      <p>Yes. The capsule is HPMC (vegetable cellulose). The formula is also free from gluten, dairy, soy and GMO ingredients.</p></details>

      <details><summary>How does the 90-day guarantee work?</summary>
      <p>Try a full bottle. If within 90 days of your purchase you don't feel a meaningful shift, email support and we'll refund the full purchase price — no return shipping required, no restocking fee.</p></details>

      <details><summary>How do I cancel my subscription?</summary>
      <p>Two clicks from your account page. No phone calls, no chat queues. We don't believe in subscription traps.</p></details>

